- **Note for C# users:** If your issue is *not* C#-specific, please upload a minimal reproduction project written in GDScript. This will make it easier for contributors to reproduce the issue locally as not everyone has a .NET setup available. \n\nThe steps are pretty vague so it could be difficult to replicate reliably ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4750409405/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4843157334","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120407#issuecomment-4843157334","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120407","id":4843157334,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIKy3Vg","user":{"login":"Atermnus","id":18173622,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTczNjIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18173622?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atermnus","html_url":"https://github.com/Atermnus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atermnus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atermnus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atermnus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atermnus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atermnus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atermnus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atermnus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atermnus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atermnus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-30T12:00:26Z","updated_at":"2026-06-30T12:01:07Z","body":"Essentially from further investigation, the editor seems to try and load the inherited scenes first in the custom resources, without resolving the base class first.\n\nRunning the project from command prompt seems to work, but running the project from inside the editor shows that the inherited scenes are corrupted and not working.\n\nNot sure how to do a MRP given that this problem arises from upgrading a project and not in the project itself, any suggestion would be helpful.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4843157334/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4843252619","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120407#issuecomment-4843252619","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120407","id":4843252619,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIK4riw","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-30T12:12:23Z","updated_at":"2026-06-30T12:12:23Z","body":"Given the vagueness of the description I can't really give much of a suggestion other than trying to produce a project that causes this bug, or stripping down an existing one until it is minimal ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4843252619/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4843496255","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120407#issuecomment-4843496255","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120407","id":4843496255,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABILHjPw","user":{"login":"Atermnus","id":18173622,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTczNjIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18173622?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atermnus","html_url":"https://github.com/Atermnus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atermnus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atermnus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atermnus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atermnus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atermnus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atermnus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atermnus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atermnus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atermnus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-30T12:32:50Z","updated_at":"2026-06-30T12:35:29Z","body":"Tried re-creating an MRP and I can't reproduce it unfortunately. Any ideas on how to proceed?\n\nAfter running the engine in verbose mode and printing it out in a log, the engine hasn't finished loading the dependency before resolving the dependents, and this seems to occur only in custom resources that have as an exported variable inherited scenes.\n\nMy project is rather complicated (a few gigabytes) so I'm not sure I can replicate the exact steps easily.\n\nI'll try to explain it without becoming pedantic.\n\nThere is an abstract class called \"Seal_Class\", and when I open the project in the editor, in the log it shows that it's trying to load it.\n```\nLoading resource: res://Unit/seal_class.tscn remapped: res://Unit/seal_class.tscn\nLoading resource: res://Unit/Seal_Class.gd remapped: res://Unit/Seal_Class.gd\n```\nHowever, before successfully loading the Seal_Class (so before the Completed Load message for that), the editor tries to load a custom resource, that has an inherited Seal_Class scene in its exported fields, and fails to load it.\n```\nLoading resource: res://Resources/tres_files/Seals/Venus_Charms.tres remapped: res://Resources/tres_files/Seals/Venus_Charms.tres\nLoading resource: res://Seals/Seals_New/Tier_1_Seals/Venus_Charms_Seal.tscn remapped: res://Seals/Seals_New/Tier_1_Seals/Venus_Charms_Seal.tscn\nERROR: res://Seals/Seals_New/Tier_1_Seals/Venus_Charms_Seal.tscn:107 - Parse Error: .\n   at: _printerr (scene/resources/resource_format_text.cpp:41)\nFailed loading resource: res://Seals/Seals_New/Tier_1_Seals/Venus_Charms_Seal.tscn\n```\nThis happens for every resource that has a scene in its exported fields, including other inherited scenes & custom resources.\n\nThe editor then loads the base class\n`Completed load for: 'res://Unit/seal_class.tscn' remapped 'res://Unit/seal_class.tscn' at thread -1`\nbut much much further down the line.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4843496255/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused